    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_14",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "The Storvreta Innebandyklubb or Storvreta IBK, is a floorball club based in Storvreta, Sweden. The men's team plays in Sweden's highest floorball league, the SSL. They won the Swedish national championship in 2010, 2011, 2012, 2016, 2018 and 2019.",
